comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-25T05:13:05.253Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check evidence: searched all statuses for MCP deprecated Roots Sampling Logging Dynamic Client Registration HTTP SSE includeContext ping initialize sessions and migration. Existing terminal issues fix individual old-protocol behavior but no item owns revision-wide removal."
  "2026-08-25T05:18:53.030Z","harness:codex","Graph governance: the authorization prerequisite pm-3zh9s4 already carries the transport, stateless-foundation, and ADR chain, so two redundant direct blocked_by rows were removed without weakening execution order."
body: "## Migration ledger\n\n- initialize and notifications/initialized: replace with request-local metadata and server/discover.\n- ping: remove from canonical server and tests.\n- logging/setLevel: replace with request-local logLevel metadata, stderr for stdio, and OpenTelemetry for remote observability.\n- notifications/roots/list_changed and Roots: pass directories or files through tool parameters, resource URIs, or server configuration.\n- Sampling and includeContext legacy values: integrate directly with provider APIs when needed and omit or use none during compatibility.\n- HTTP+SSE, GET endpoints, session headers, and SSE resumability: replace with Streamable HTTP POST and explicit retry.\n- Dynamic Client Registration: prefer Client ID Metadata Documents with bounded fallback.\n- resources subscribe methods: replace with subscriptions/listen.\n\nEvery adapter declares owner, supported era, telemetry, security consequences, sunset evidence, and removal gate."
